{"c":[{"id":"5b20009202fb8dab","sum":"caret-heavy prune deletes inputs/vm-job/runs: copy guest evidence out first. Ask has one maker (heads); tests needing a stated intent use HelperOptions.ask {maker:'scripted'}; heads never gives scope 'all', so next-page carry only comes from a scripted intent.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261009T094824Z-f579be04c067ac3a","text":"caret-heavy prune deletes inputs/vm-job/runs (the whole guest evidence); copy the run directory out before pruning an r2-vm job.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261009T105413Z-5b58229438c03538","text":"Ask has one maker (heads). Tests needing a stated intent use HelperOptions.ask {maker:'scripted'} (page-rig.ts scriptedIntent); heads never gives scope 'all', so page kind 'all' and next-page carry only arise from a scripted intent.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"3c167740aee70ffb","sum":"kinds.ts readerValue and TypedValues.swift membershipNumber share word lists (membership digit runs are ids): change both. VERIFY_CUTOFF stays 0.75: lowering needs ~100 labelled wrong answers in the band; W2 had 32 in 0.65-0.75.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261009T133022Z-c6da35b2ee65e6ca","text":"Reader typed-value kinds have a helper-side correction: fill/kinds.ts readerValue retypes a bare digit run on a loyalty/membership line from phone to id; TypedValues.swift membershipNumber applies the same word lists. Change both together.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261009T133022Z-f6d432411519e4b6","text":"VERIFY_CUTOFF (fill/contract.ts) stays 0.75 by the Oct 9 sweep: lowering it needs ~100 labelled wrong verifier answers in the new band; W2's dev-set run had only 32 between 0.65 and 0.75.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
